# LinkedIn automation (Cursor-only)

Monorepo path: **`LinkedIn Automation/`**. All file paths in this rule prefix with that folder — e.g. `LinkedIn Automation/drafts/YYYY-MM-DD.md`.

Before writing any post or comment, **read `LinkedIn Automation/content/VOICE.md`**. The full operating manual is in `LinkedIn Automation/.cursor/rules/linkedin-automation.mdc`.

There is no Python, no browser automation, no API key. Cursor writes files; Sahil copy-pastes into LinkedIn manually.
